            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Choose your terminal app.</b> "Open in Terminal" now uses whichever terminal you pick in <b>Settings → Terminal</b> — iTerm2, Warp, Ghostty, WezTerm, Tabby, Hyper, or the built-in Terminal — with an <b>"Other…"</b> chooser for any other app. It still defaults to the system Terminal, so nothing changes unless you want it to, and the choice takes effect on your next "Open in Terminal".</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
